WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:06.239
- The first time I took
ecstasy was in Manchester.

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:07.407
I was thinking, what is this?

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:09.309
This is pretty boring.

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:15.014
Then all of a sudden my knees
just completely buckle and time

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.516
just started to stand still.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:23.790
[music playing]

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:27.627
The whole room is just throbbing
and everybody's dancing.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:31.164
And the music's just
pulsing into my head.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:34.567
All these beeps
and weird noises,

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:37.837
like signals from outer space
that I didn't understand

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:41.841
now completely making sense.

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:44.277
I never wanted the party
to end after that night.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:46.679
Raving became my religion.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:49.249
I'm Shaun Attwood, known as
one of the biggest ecstasy

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:52.051
traffickers in
the US rave scene.

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:54.454
My local nickname
was English Shaun.

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:59.659
I was up against one of the Cosa
Nostras most notorious killers.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:02.529
[music playing]

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:14.841
As a young person, I set a goal
to be a millionaire by age 30.

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:17.744
Greed is good was my mantra.

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:23.583
I flew out to Arizona because
it dazzled me as a teenager.

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:31.524
The plane comes in, you're
looking out the window,

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.126
and you're seeing
all these swimming

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:35.462
pools in people's backyards.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:38.198
The sun's always shining,
it's almost 50 degrees

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.099
in the summer.

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.935
And as soon as they
hear the English accent

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:45.104
they roll out the red carpet.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:49.509
But the rave scene
was barely starting.

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:52.111
They didn't even know what
ecstasy was so there was

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.180
this huge gap in the market.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:57.383
[crowd cheering]

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:07.393
When I threw my first rave,
looking down at all the ravers

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:11.464
just going off, with the
strobe lights pulsing,

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:14.834
I knew that this was
my calling in life.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.437
[music playing]

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:19.672
- It's quarter to
six in the morning!

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:21.841
[crowd cheering]

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:28.882
- As an experiment I decided
to order 1,000 pills out of LA.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:31.684
All the stuff goes
in one weekend.

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:34.420
I've made thousands
of dollars just

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:38.491
like that, partying my ass off.

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:43.630
And that was when I decided
to go full-time trafficking.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:46.733
[music playing]

